# Set the model's joint coordinates directly, without running IK.
#
# Only the coordinates named in pose.name are touched -- everything else keeps
# the value it already has, so a partial pose is legal and useful (lock one
# joint, sweep another). Names are OpenSim coordinate names; positions are
# radians for rotational coordinates and metres for translational ones.
# velocity and effort are ignored: the model is realized to Position only.
sensor_msgs/JointState pose
---
bool ok
# empty on success; on failure, says which names were not recognised
string message
